      "label": "Exoticization",
      "description": "The meme uses the concept of exoticization, which involves portraying people from certain cultures or racial groups as strange, primitive, or non-human to create a humorous or absurd effect. In this case, the children are portrayed as 'sea monkeys,' which is a form of exoticization that reduces their humanity and reinforces harmful stereotypes about dark-skinned people.",
